; orchard_counterweights.room - Os Contrapesos (design 04 section 3.6): Outono Logico 1 (design 02 section 8), shortcut from the mill town to the terraces.
; Entered from the mill loft through the floor mouth. The lift (col 10) rises 14 rows to the block tops while plate_lift holds; the load over
; plate_jam locks it. Soltar from the east niche reaches only the right load (12 cells apart); from the lift it reaches both. From the top,
; the drop column (cols 17-18) leads to the terraces' upper ledge; it cannot be climbed back without wall climb.

